# Edge Rover: the trigger is "when this creature dies" - put into a graveyard from the battlefield (CR 700.4). Swords to
# Plowshares exiles it, so nobody creates a Lander: both battlefields hold only what they did. Rover's controller still
# gains 2 life (its power) from the Swords, proving the Swords resolved on the Rover. The positive control, the same
# Rover bolted and dying, is edge-rover-dies-and-each-player-creates-a-lander-the-opponents-works-for-the-opponent.

